{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 11, :comments ["<b>From vapor it diminishes</b> — by robbery and theft it will not succeed." "<b>And one who gathers by hand</b> — on account of the toil of the hand, he will increase his wealth. And likewise: 'and YHWH blessed you on my foot' — on account of the toil of my foot."], :book :proverbs, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 13, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Proverbs -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/mishley/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:22:31.632681806Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}